gbf0(){return"Three colours of scale"},
gbeZ(){return"A major scale sounds bright and happy. Listen to it climb."},
gbf_(){return"A minor scale sounds darker \u2014 its 3rd, 6th and 7th steps sit a little lower."},
gbeY(){return"Dorian is like minor, but its 6th step is raised \u2014 so it sounds minor with a brighter twist. That one note is the whole secret!"},
